#. module: spp_approval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:spp_approval.field_spp_approval_definition__cel_condition
msgid ""
"CEL expression that determines when this approval applies.\n"
"\n"
"Available variables:\n"
"- record: The record being approved (with all fields)\n"
"- user: Current user submitting for approval\n"
"- company: Current company\n"
"- today: Current date\n"
"- now: Current datetime\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"- record.amount > 10000\n"
"- record.state == \"draft\" && record.partner_id.id != 0\n"
"- record.total_amount > 5000 || record.category == \"high_risk\"\n"
"- size(record.line_ids.ids) > 10\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Expression CEL qui détermine quand cette approbation s'applique.\n"
"\n"
"Variables disponibles :\n"
"- record : L'enregistrement en cours d'approbation (avec tous les champs)\n"
"- user : Utilisateur actuel soumettant pour approbation\n"
"- company : Société actuelle\n"
"- today : Date du jour\n"
"- now : Date et heure actuelles\n"
"\n"
"Exemples :\n"
"- record.amount > 10000\n"
"- record.state == \\"draft\\" && record.partner_id.id != 0\n"
"- record.total_amount > 5000 || record.category == \\"high_risk\\"\n"
"- size(record.line_ids.ids) > 10\n"
"        "

#. module: spp_approval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:spp_approval.field_spp_approval_definition__cel_reviewer_expression
msgid ""
"CEL expression that returns user ID(s) for dynamic reviewer assignment.\n"
"\n"
"Available variables: Same as CEL Condition\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"- record.manager_id.id\n"
"- record.department_id.manager_id.user_id.id\n"
"- [record.user_id.id, record.manager_id.id]\n"
"\n"
"The expression should return:\n"
"- A single user ID (integer)\n"
"- A list of user IDs\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Expression CEL qui renvoie l'ID utilisateur (ou les ID utilisateurs) pour l'affectation dynamique du réviseur.\n"
"\n"
"Variables disponibles : identiques à Condition CEL\n"
"\n"
"Exemples :\n"
"- record.manager_id.id\n"
"- record.department_id.manager_id.user_id.id\n"
"- [record.user_id.id, record.manager_id.id]\n"
"\n"
"L'expression doit renvoyer :\n"
"- Un seul ID utilisateur (entier)\n"
"- Une liste d'ID utilisateur\n"
"        "

